Vendored and adapted code
-------------------------

- kitchen/retwitch-patches/src/vendor: copied verbatim from
  MorpheApp/morphe-patches-library, GPL-3.0. Upstream headers are retained.
- Promotions and display ad patches: adapted from ryykitty/twitch-patched,
  GPL-3.0. That project in turn credits bakwudo/uyu (GPL-3.0),
  arandomhooman/hoomans-morphe-patches (GPL-3.0) and scamorza/TwitchAdBlock (MIT).
- Sleep timer, player reload and VOD chapters: adapted from NyanArchive/PurpleTV,
  Apache-2.0, Copyright 2022 TwitchMod.
- Other clients' badges and settings backup: adapted from
  alienware377/PurpleTV-ReVive, Apache-2.0, Copyright 2022 TwitchMod.
- Stream ad swapping (ads/SsaiSwapEngine and the playlist handling around it): a
  Java port of VAFT from pixeltris/TwitchAdSolutions and ryanbr/TwitchAdSolutions,
  MIT, Copyright (c) 2020-present TwitchAdSolutions Contributors.
- Sub-only VODs (ads/SubVods): adapted from besuper/TwitchNoSub, Apache-2.0.
- Proxy request format: the TTV LOL convention from younesaassila/ttv-lol-pro,
  GPL-3.0.

Studied for their approach: sabopura/sabopura-morphe-patches,
jordanwoodson/lurk-morphe-patches, Overhypedcat/overhypedcat-twitch-patches
(all GPL-3.0). P1sec/hermes-dec (AGPL-3.0) is a local research tool only and is
not part of the mod.


